  "notes": [
    "Three complete Ghidra-analyzed cdecl bodies: storage allocation and god-status lookup return full DWORD values; composite display is void.",
    "Storage allocation scans slots1..199 at stride196 and recomputes actual city resource availability before scanning, even on failure.",
    "Kinds71/72 initialize36 reject bytes and two WORD limits of3200; type71 opens food ids, type72 nonfood ids, and70/190 query actual household-consumption resource ids.",
    "Type70/190 reload the resource count after each query; type71 food count and type72 resource count remain cached.",
    "Display caches root X/Y, chosen god image group, combined view and permutation, but reloads root orientation for each part and reads its current table group, size and sprite bank.",
    "Combined view subtracts8 once using a signed comparison; geometry has distinct orientations0/1 and an unshifted fallback for other bytes. No guessed modulo or coordinate clamp.",
    "God status lookup compares five signed WORDs with the full DWORD argument and returns the first index or -1. Display prefers status2, then1, then index0."
